## <!\[if !supportLists\]>2.2. <!\[endif\]>Constraints

There are three constraints you need to be aware of to install the K2view Azure Application within your Azure subscription.

<!\[if !supportLists\]>· <!\[endif\]>**Azure Subscription Type**. You will be installing the K2view Azure Application in an Azure Subscription that needs to be a Pay-As-You-Go (PAYG) or Enterprise Agreement subscription.

<!\[if !supportLists\]>· <!\[endif\]>**Subscription Role and Permission.** The installer of the K2view Azure Application needs specific Subscription level roles and permissions.

<!\[if !supportLists\]>o <!\[endif\]>The user needs to be a Subscription Owner.

<!\[if !supportLists\]>o <!\[endif\]>The user performing the K2view Azure Application installation requires the Microsoft.Authorization roleAssignments of write, read, and delete within the subscription. We describe how to [create a custom role](#_Permissions_and_Custom) for this purpose.

<!\[if !supportLists\]>· <!\[endif\]>**Region and availability zones**. Please note that the installation requires you select an Azure region that offers more than one availability zones. Not all Azure Regions support multiple availability zone.

  

